<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="1ee18e82">&lt;p&gt;
    Review the gathered requirements and the enabiling business capabilities and process flows and determine the set of
    capabilities or topics that will be covered in each workshop. For example, a workshop session could focus on one or
    some of the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Invoice-to-payment
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Record-to-report
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Source-to-pay
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Financial consolidation and reporting
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Planning and budgeting
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Period end close
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
